","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1410730003","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不！我的内脏……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730202:":{"key":"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730202:","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1410730202","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"啊……啊！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730201:":{"key":"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730201:","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1410730201","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"女王……感谢您的恩典！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1410730101:0":{"key":"say:4:1410730101:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730101","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"看到了吗？这就是弥萨忒的诅咒。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1410730102:0":{"key":"say:5:1410730102:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730102","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"多么讽刺啊……地表的清水，这世间最普通的恩赐，却是我族...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1410730103:0":{"key":"say:6:1410730103:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730103","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"一开始是剧痛，随后是疯狂，最后……沦为失去理智的怪物。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1410730104:0":{"key":"say:7:1410730104:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730104","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"两千年前，我带领着最骁勇的绿裔战士们离开故土，可最终…...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1410730105:0":{"key":"say:8:1410730105:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730105","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"命运此时却再度眷顾了我们，我找到了龙，准确地说，是沉睡...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1410730106:0":{"key":"say:9:1410730106:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730106","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我不知道它为何在此沉睡，但我希望它永远不要醒来。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1410730107:0":{"key":"say:10:1410730107:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730107","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"因为龙之力足以与神明相抗，利用初始之龙，艾塞勒将再也不...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1410730108:0":{"key":"say:11:1410730108:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730108","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但初始之龙的力量太过强大，难以驾驭。我不得不退而求其次...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1410730109:0":{"key":"say:12:1410730109:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730109","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"经过千百次的失败，我成功了。恩典灵露，终于诞生了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1410730110:0":{"key":"say:13:1410730110:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1410730110","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你们以为我在